{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ShortcutRemapper"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keys go out as they are pressed, modifiers included, so nothing is delayed. When a non-modifier"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"key goes down with exactly a rule’s modifiers held, the Mac’s modifiers change to the output’s,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"then the output’s key goes down. While the trigger’s modifiers stay held, every key pressed goes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the output’s modifiers in place of the trigger’s, so ⌥⇥ ⇥ ⇥ walks the Mac’s App Switcher","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and letting go of ⌥ lets go of ⌘. Then the Mac’s modifiers match the keys held here again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/documentation\/HeadwireInput"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/documentation\/HeadwireInput\/ShortcutRemapper"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/documentation\/HeadwireInput\/ShortcutRemapper\/init()"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/documentation\/HeadwireInput\/ShortcutRemapper\/process(_:rules:)","doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/documentation\/HeadwireInput\/ShortcutRemapper\/reset()"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Turns hardware key events into what the Mac gets once the person’s shortcuts apply"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyboard-shortcuts"},{"text":"): the one place a chord pressed here is remapped, on every input path.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"HeadwireInput"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ShortcutRemapper"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"ShortcutRemapper","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:13HeadwireInput16ShortcutRemapperV","title":"ShortcutRemapper","symbolKind":"struct"},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/headwireinput\/shortcutremapper"]}],"references":{"doc://HeadwireInput/documentation/HeadwireInput/ShortcutRemapper":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ShortcutRemapper"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/documentation\/HeadwireInput\/ShortcutRemapper","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ShortcutRemapper"}],"title":"ShortcutRemapper","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Turns hardware key events into what the Mac gets once the person’s shortcuts apply"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyboard-shortcuts"},{"type":"text","text":"): the one place a chord pressed here is remapped, on every input path."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/headwireinput\/shortcutremapper"},"doc://HeadwireInput/documentation/HeadwireInput/ShortcutRemapper/process(_:rules:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The events to send for one event, under ","type":"text"},{"code":"rules","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Only key events change.","type":"text"}],"title":"process(_:rules:)","url":"\/documentation\/headwireinput\/shortcutremapper\/process(_:rules:)","ki